author": {"steamid": "76561198313208812", "personaname": "Pyronier", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198313208812/", "num_games_owned": 32, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7052, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6905, "last_played": 1787963790, "avatar": "fef49e7fa7e1997310d705b2a6158ff8dc1cdfeb"}, "language": "english", "review": "Trying to build in this game is so insanely glitchy and frustrating. There are just random spots in air where you can't build. At least with walls, you can use a trick to replace diagonals with normal walls but you can't do that with roofs at all. There's no pattern at all to where the spots are either. I'll be building a base and there will be a random spot in the middle of the third floor where I just can't build because of \"overlap\". There are plenty of other glitches still that have been pretty easy to just ignore and deal with but the building is the straw that broke the camel's back. The main story was pretty fun but there isn't much to do in the post game either.", "timestamp_created": 1787526786, "timestamp_updated": 1787526786, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 4, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.537983119487762451", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233552970", "author": {"steamid": "76561198325119990", "personaname": "Hydro0", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198325119990/", "num_games_owned": 202, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 8881, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8878, "last_played": 1787527238, "avatar": "99a251d72d4d64c8bfb690e2f5a6f3cac20cd209"}, "language": "english", "review": "pokemon but base automating and guns??", "timestamp_created": 1787526419, "timestamp_updated": 1787526419, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233550959", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147319299", "personaname": "Tacitus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Tacticux/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 8315, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8315, "last_played": 1787524043, "avatar": "757000e3692c9975424ecdb8b85ae8512797fbf2"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fun and simple game to its core. The game does not take itself seriously and takes the player on a journey to have fun. The concept of the game is quite simple, quests are easy to follow, pals are easy enough to capture and train. \r\n\r\nThe overall gameplay loop and endgame stuffs are negligible at best, however like the Devs said, once we finish the game we should look elsewhere and come back once more stuff drops, which is exactly what I will be doing (hopefully with more lore pieces on the side). Easily one of the most memorable game I have played in this year thus far.\r\n\r\nReally looking forward to more updates in the future.", "timestamp_created": 1787524309, "timestamp_updated": 1787524309, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233550277", "author": {"steamid": "76561198193562563", "personaname": "kz-6", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/iznxai/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 10622, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4808, "last_played": 1789870623, "avatar": "074d62c97dd898751d2d49647d1712fbd6f68936"}, "language": "english", "review": "gun and ball game", "timestamp_created": 1787523609, "timestamp_updated": 1787523609, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32721", "os": "Windows 10", "cpu_name": "AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor             ", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060", "vram_size": 12115}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "233549914", "author": {"steamid": "76561197986045586", "personaname": "Danny Crane", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/danny_crane/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 12410, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 9701, "last_played": 1788903359, "avatar": "1abda96905d0ec8e8d32f710526123634ba93d3c"}, "language": "english", "review": "I played this game pretty early in beta and saw some cool ideas but it was far from fun.\r\n\r\nAs of 1.0, Palworld is a complete game that is genuinely tons of fun.\r\n\r\nOnly criticism is they need to tune some things like XP gain (leveling is too fast to explore content), pal catch rates (even with the right ball, this is frustrating given how expensive they get later in the game), and a few others (e.g. night should be longer). You can touch these up in the custom difficulty settings to bring it closer to where it needs to be, and I hope to see future patches make small improvements and additional QoLs.", "timestamp_created": 1787523247, "timestamp_updated": 1787523247, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase":